1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,155
Did you ever just have the idea?

2
00:00:03,855 --> 00:00:05,468
The path to financial freedom,

3
00:00:05,498 --> 00:00:08,231
then it died in an AI chat box.

4
00:00:08,931 --> 00:00:12,544
because you didn't have the means to push it through and see it live?

5
00:00:12,694 --> 00:00:16,420
Or is the projects section on your résumé looking a little...

6
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:17,296
rough?

7
00:00:17,446 --> 00:00:19,057
And you're tired of all those

8
00:00:19,087 --> 00:00:20,661
'thanks for your application'

9
00:00:20,691 --> 00:00:21,704
emails?

10
00:00:21,954 --> 00:00:23,514
Introducing...

11
00:00:24,214 --> 00:00:25,340
Spitch.

12
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:31,055
It's a way to broadcast your idea, get visibility, partnerships and collaborations.

13
00:00:31,085 --> 00:00:38,721
Pitch it in less than a minute, post it, and people swipe right or left, based on what they see, to connect with you and push it forward.

14
00:00:38,751 --> 00:00:42,677
Pitchers and builders, those with the means and those with the skills,

15
00:00:42,707 --> 00:00:45,102
connecting for the price of a coffee.

16
00:00:45,252 --> 00:00:47,888
The market starts here, at uOttawa.

17
00:00:48,038 --> 00:00:51,946
I'm a fourth-year engineering student. I live this problem.

18
00:00:52,646 --> 00:00:56,245
If you think this would make a great LinkedIn post, let's chat.

19
00:00:56,445 --> 00:00:57,720
Or swipe right.
